    <div class="cg-topline"><span><i></i> SYSTEM ONLINE</span><span>VANTA//FORM_07 <b>PERSONAL TRAINING LAB</b></span><span>JKT / ONLINE <b>↗</b></span></div>
    <header class="cg-header"><a href="#cg-home" class="cg-brand"><span class="cg-brand-mark">V</span><span><strong>VANTA<span>//</span>FORM</strong><small>HUMAN PERFORMANCE LAB</small></span></a><button class="cg-menu" id="cgMenu" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button><nav id="cgNav"><a href="#cg-home">01 / HOME</a><a href="#cg-programs">02 / PROGRAMS</a><a href="#cg-trainer">03 / TRAINER</a><a href="#cg-progress">04 / PROGRESS</a><a class="cg-nav-cta" href="#cg-booking">INITIATE <b>↗</b></a></nav></header>
    <main>
        <section class="cg-hero" id="cg-home"><div class="cg-hero-grid"><div class="cg-hero-copy"><div class="cg-live"><span></span> YOUR NEXT FORM IS LOADING</div><h1>UNLEASH<br><em>YOUR</em><br>POTENTIAL<span class="cg-dot">.</span></h1><p>High-performance coaching for people who refuse to train on autopilot. Build power, precision, and a body that moves like it means it.</p><div class="cg-actions"><a class="cg-button cg-neon-button" href="#cg-booking">Start your transformation <b>↗</b></a><a class="cg-outline-link" href="#cg-programs">Explore programs <b>↓</b></a></div><div class="cg-hero-meta"><div><span>01</span><b>COACHING MODE</b><small>HUMAN + DATA</small></div><div><span>02</span><b>ACTIVE MEMBERS</b><small>247 / 300 SLOTS</small></div><div><span>03</span><b>BASE LOCATION</b><small>JAKARTA, ID</small></div></div></div><div class="cg-hero-art"><div class="cg-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="cg-orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="cg-scan-line"></div><div class="cg-image-wrap"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534438327276-14e5300c3a48?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=88" alt="Athlete training in a dark modern gym"></div><div class="cg-glow-tag cg-tag-top">FORM / 07<br><b>READY</b></div><div class="cg-glow-tag cg-tag-bottom"><span>ATHLETE_001</span><b>TRAINING<br>STATE: ON</b></div><div class="cg-coordinates">-6.2088° S<br>106.8456° E</div></div></div><div class="cg-hero-bottom"><span>STRENGTH</span><i></i><span>CONDITIONING</span><i></i><span>BODY COMPOSITION</span><i></i><span>PERFORMANCE</span></div></section>
        <section class="cg-statement cg-section"><div class="cg-index">[ 001 ]<br><span>THE SIGNAL</span></div><div><h2>STOP CHASING<br>RANDOM. <em>START<br>BUILDING.</em></h2><p>VANTA//FORM turns hard work into a repeatable system. Every session has a purpose, every metric tells a story, and every version of you gets stronger than the last.</p><a class="cg-text-link" href="#cg-method">Decode the method <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="cg-statement-code"><span>INPUT</span><strong>INTENT</strong><span>OUTPUT</span><strong>CAPABILITY</strong><span>STATUS</span><strong class="cg-green">EVOLVING_</strong></div></section>
        <section class="cg-programs cg-section" id="cg-programs"><div class="cg-section-head"><div><span class="cg-eyebrow">SELECT YOUR PROTOCOL / 02</span><h2>PROGRAMS<br>BUILT TO <em>BREAK<br>THE PATTERN.</em></h2></div><p>Choose your entry point. We will calibrate the intensity, volume, and pace to your current level — then push the ceiling.</p></div><div class="cg-program-filter" role="tablist"><button class="is-active" data-filter="all" type="button">ALL SYSTEMS</button><button data-filter="strength" type="button">STRENGTH</button><button data-filter="conditioning" type="button">CONDITIONING</button><button data-filter="composition" type="button">COMPOSITION</button></div><div class="cg-program-grid"><article data-type="strength"><div class="cg-card-top"><span>V/F-01</span><b>LVL 01</b></div><div class="cg-program-symbol">＋</div><h3>FORCE//BUILD</h3><p>Progressive strength training to add lean mass, improve mechanics, and make heavy feel intentional.</p><div class="cg-card-meta"><span>3–5 DAYS / WEEK</span><span>STRENGTH</span></div><a href="#cg-booking">Load protocol <b>↗</b></a></article><article data-type="conditioning"><div class="cg-card-top"><span>V/F-02</span><b>LVL 02</b></div><div class="cg-program-symbol">◒</div><h3>ENGINE//HIIT</h3><p>High-output intervals that build work capacity, speed, and the confidence to stay in the hard part.</p><div class="cg-card-meta"><span>2–4 DAYS / WEEK</span><span>CONDITIONING</span></div><a href="#cg-booking">Load protocol <b>↗</b></a></article><article data-type="composition"><div class="cg-card-top"><span>V/F-03</span><b>LVL 02</b></div><div class="cg-program-symbol">↘</div><h3>RECODE//LEAN</h3><p>Body-composition coaching combining smart lifting, nutrition signals, and habits that survive real life.</p><div class="cg-card-meta"><span>12 WEEK CYCLE</span><span>COMPOSITION</span></div><a href="#cg-booking">Load protocol <b>↗</b></a></article><article data-type="strength"><div class="cg-card-top"><span>V/F-04</span><b>LVL 03</b></div><div class="cg-program-symbol">◎</div><h3>LIMIT//OFF</h3><p>One-to-one performance coaching for athletes and ambitious humans ready for their next measurable edge.</p><div class="cg-card-meta"><span>PRIVATE COACHING</span><span>PERFORMANCE</span></div><a href="#cg-booking">Load protocol <b>↗</b></a></article></div></section>
        <section class="cg-method cg-section" id="cg-method"><div class="cg-method-visual"><div class="cg-ring"><span>V//F</span></div><div class="cg-method-readout"><span>PROTOCOL STATUS</span><strong>OPTIMIZED</strong><i><b></b></i></div></div><div class="cg-method-copy"><span class="cg-eyebrow">THE VANTA//FORM SYSTEM / 03</span><h2>DATA IS USELESS<br>WITHOUT <em>DIRECTION.</em></h2><p>We use performance data to make your training more personal, not more complicated. Four phases. One clear direction.</p><div class="cg-phase-list"><div><b>01</b><span><strong>SCAN</strong><small>Assess movement, habits, goals, and constraints.</small></span><i>+</i></div><div><b>02</b><span><strong>BUILD</strong><small>Install your training rhythm and technical base.</small></span><i>+</i></div><div><b>03</b><span><strong>OVERLOAD</strong><small>Increase the challenge with precision, not ego.</small></span><i>+</i></div><div><b>04</b><span><strong>EVOLVE</strong><small>Review the signal, then unlock the next level.</small></span><i>+</i></div></div></div></section>
        <section class="cg-trainer cg-section" id="cg-trainer"><div class="cg-trainer-copy"><span class="cg-eyebrow">YOUR OPERATOR / 04</span><h2>COACHING<br>WITH A <em>HUMAN<br>SIGNAL.</em></h2><p>Meet Kai. Strength coach, movement nerd, and the person behind the system. No shouting for show — just sharp eyes, good questions, and a plan that meets you where you are.</p><div class="cg-trainer-facts"><span><b>CSCS</b> CERTIFIED</span><span><b>10+</b> YEARS COACHING</span><span><b>1,200</b> ATHLETES SERVED</span></div><a class="cg-text-link" href="#cg-booking">Connect with Kai <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="cg-trainer-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019613454-1cb2f99b2d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=88" alt="Personal trainer coaching in a neon-lit gym"><span class="cg-image-label">KAI / OPERATOR<br><b>VERIFIED COACH</b></span></div></section>
        <section class="cg-progress cg-section" id="cg-progress"><div class="cg-section-head"><div><span class="cg-eyebrow">LIVE PROGRESS FEED / 05</span><h2>THE NUMBERS<br>DON'T <em>LIE.</em></h2></div><p>Progress is not a before-and-after. It is the growing proof that your system is working.</p></div><div class="cg-progress-layout"><div class="cg-metric-main"><div class="cg-metric-label"><span>ATHLETE_001 / 16 WEEK CYCLE</span><b>+32.8%</b></div><h3>COMPOUND<br>STRENGTH</h3><div class="cg-bars"><i style="height:22%"></i><i style="height:32%"></i><i style="height:39%"></i><i style="height:46%"></i><i style="height:58%"></i><i style="height:69%"></i><i style="height:80%"></i><i style="height:94%"></i></div><div class="cg-axis"><span>W01</span><span>W04</span><span>W08</span><span>W12</span><span>W16</span></div></div><div class="cg-metric-side"><div><span>BODY FAT</span><strong>-14.2<span>%</span></strong><small>16 week average</small></div><div><span>CONSISTENCY</span><strong>92<span>%</span></strong><small>session completion</small></div><div><span>MEMBER RATING</span><strong>4.9<span>/5</span></strong><small>current pulse</small></div></div></div></section>
        <section class="cg-stories cg-section"><div class="cg-section-head"><div><span class="cg-eyebrow">TRANSMISSIONS / 06</span><h2>REAL PEOPLE.<br><em>REAL OUTPUT.</em></h2></div><a class="cg-text-link" href="#cg-booking">View all transmissions <b>↗</b></a></div><div class="cg-story-grid"><article><span>CASE_031 / 12 WEEKS</span><strong>“I stopped<br>negotiating<br>with myself.”</strong><p>— Naya / RECODE//LEAN</p></article><article><span>CASE_044 / 24 WEEKS</span><strong>“Stronger is<br>my new<br>normal.”</strong><p>— Dimas / FORCE//BUILD</p></article><article><span>CASE_052 / 16 WEEKS</span><strong>“The plan<br>finally feels<br>like mine.”</strong><p>— Rani / ENGINE//HIIT</p></article></div></section>
        <section class="cg-booking cg-section" id="cg-booking"><div class="cg-booking-copy"><span class="cg-eyebrow">OPEN A CHANNEL / 07</span><h2>READY TO<br>CHANGE YOUR<br><em>DEFAULT?</em></h2><p>Send your signal. We will reply with a 20-minute calibration call and the clearest next step for your goals.</p><div class="cg-booking-status"><span></span><b>INTAKE IS OPEN</b><small>Next available: within 48 hours</small></div></div><form id="cgBookingForm"><div class="cg-form-heading"><span>NEW ATHLETE INTAKE</span><b>FORM_07</b></div><label>IDENTIFIER / NAME *<input name="name" required placeholder="Your name"></label><div class="cg-form-row"><label>EMAIL *<input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@email.com"></label><label>WHATSAPP *<input type="tel" name="phone" required placeholder="08xxxxxxxxxx"></label></div><label>SELECT YOUR PROTOCOL<select name="program"><option>Choose a program</option><option>FORCE//BUILD — Strength</option><option>ENGINE//HIIT — Conditioning</option><option>RECODE//LEAN — Composition</option><option>LIMIT//OFF — Performance</option></select></label><label>YOUR CURRENT SIGNAL<textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell us your goal, current routine, or what is not working..."></textarea></label><button class="cg-button cg-neon-button" type="submit">Send transmission <b>↗</b></button><p class="cg-form-status" id="cgFormStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></section>
        <section class="cg-faq cg-section" id="cg-faq"><div><span class="cg-eyebrow">DECRYPTION / 08</span><h2>FREQUENTLY<br><em>ASKED.</em></h2></div><div class="cg-faq-list"><details><summary>Do I need to be advanced to start?<b>+</b></summary><p>No. We calibrate every program to your starting point. The only prerequisite is a willingness to show up and learn.</p></details><details><summary>How do online sessions work?<b>+</b></summary><p>You receive your plan in our coaching platform, video feedback on key lifts, and a weekly check-in with Kai.</p></details><details><summary>Can I train in person in Jakarta?<b>+</b></summary><p>Yes. In-person sessions run from our private training lab in South Jakarta, with limited weekly intake.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after I submit the form?<b>+</b></summary><p>We open a WhatsApp channel, review your goals, and schedule a short calibration call. No pressure, no hard sell.</p></details></div></section>
    </main>
